  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="c8457f79-ceb6-5a3c-9cd1-c1a5c19ca2ca" activityNameId="224a4166-eeb8-548e-b6d9-ff9e6ae68095" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Fatty alcohol sulfate, coconut oil, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fatty alcohol sulfate, coconut oil, at plant
data based on the ECOSOL study of the European surfactant industry. Allocations in multioutput processes were made, using the relative mass outputs of products.;
Synonyms: FAS aus Kokosnussöl; 
UUID: 51ba64b5-78ed-37e1-ac41-ec1b3fa99503
This module contains material and energy input, production of waste and emissions for the production of fatty alcohol sulfonate out of coconut oil. Transports and infrastructure have been estimated. No water consumption included.
Location: Data based on the European fatty alcohol sulfonate production
Technology: Average technology for the production of FAS with short chain lengh (C12-C15), representing typical European production mix in the mid 90s
Time period: data of published literature
Production volume: na
Sampling: data out of ECOSOL study of European Surfactant Industry. Common translation rules used, reported in Chemical report (Althaus et al. 2003). 
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_51ba64b5-78ed-37e1-ac41-ec1b3fa99503.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
